      "The student advantage\nStudents often underestimate the assets they already have:\n- Subject knowledge from their coursework.\n- Access to classmates and campus communities.\n- Familiarity with tools and platforms.\n- Time windows between classes or during evenings.\n- First-hand understanding of student problems.\n- The ability to test an idea with a small, reachable audience.\nA side hustle can begin with one of these advantages. You do not need to start with a large budget, a professional studio, or a huge online following.",
