      "For students outside the United States, the Handshake work-authorisation limitation matters. Do not assume that a remote listing is automatically available to you. Check whether the platform accepts workers in your country and whether the project permits your location.",
      "How to prepare before applying\nStep 1: Identify your strongest subject.\nChoose an area where you can confidently distinguish a correct answer from a plausible-sounding wrong one.",
