      "Step 4: Prepare a short skills summary.\nDescribe your coursework, relevant projects, technical skills, language ability, and subject strengths honestly.",
      "Step 5: Apply only through legitimate channels.\nCheck the platform's official site and verify that the application is genuine. Do not pay a recruiter to access a job or provide sensitive information through an unverified message.",
      "What good evaluation looks like\nA useful evaluation should be:\n- Accurate.\n- Specific.\n- Supported by subject knowledge.\n- Consistent with the task instructions.\n- Clear about uncertainty.\n- Free of invented citations or claims.\nIf you are unsure, do not bluff. Explain the uncertainty or follow the project's escalation instructions.",
