      "First product-test plan\nWeek 1\n- Choose one category.\n- Research customer needs and competitors.\n- Identify a reliable supplier.\n- Calculate all costs.\n- Reject products with poor economics.\nWeek 2\n- Create a focused product page.\n- Check shipping, return, and support processes.\n- Publish relevant content.\n- Run a small test only within a pre-set budget.\nWeek 3\n- Review traffic and buying behaviour.\n- Ask what stopped visitors from purchasing.\n- Improve the offer or stop the test.\n- Do not scale without evidence of positive contribution."
