      "Appendix C — Weekly Review Template\nWhat I planned to do:\n-\nWhat I completed:\n-\nWhat I learned from real people:\n-\nWhat generated the strongest signal:\n-\nWhat wasted time or money:\n-\nWhat I will change next week:\n-\nMy one priority for next week:\n-\nAppendix D — The Core Lesson\nThe seven side hustles are different, but the strongest examples share a common pattern:\n- They began with a small first step.\n- They used an advantage the person already had.\n- They reached a specific audience.\n- They tested the offer or format.\n- They improved through repeated execution.\nYou do not need to start all seven. In fact, trying to run all seven at once is likely to make each one weaker.",
